    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Most parts of Spring’s architecture support internationalization, as the Spring web MVC framework does. "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "DispatcherServlet"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " lets you automatically resolve messages by using the client’s locale. This is done with "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "LocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " objects."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When a request comes in, the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "DispatcherServlet"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " looks for a locale resolver and, if it finds one, it tries to use it to set the locale. By using the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "RequestContext.getLocale()"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " method, you can always retrieve the locale that was resolved by the locale resolver."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "In addition to automatic locale resolution, you can also attach an interceptor to the handler mapping (see "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Interception"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/handlermapping-interceptor.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " for more information on handler mapping interceptors) to change the locale under specific circumstances (for example, based on a parameter in the request)."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Locale resolvers and interceptors are defined in the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "org.springframework.web.servlet.i18n"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " package and are configured in your application context in the normal way. The following selection of locale resolvers is included in Spring."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Time Zone"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/localeresolver.html#mvc-timezone"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Header Resolver"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/localeresolver.html#mvc-localeresolver-acceptheader"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Cookie Resolver"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/localeresolver.html#mvc-localeresolver-cookie"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Session Resolver"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/localeresolver.html#mvc-localeresolver-session"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Locale Interceptor"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-servlet/localeresolver.html#mvc-localeresolver-interceptor"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "In addition to obtaining the client’s locale, it is often useful to know its time zone. The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "LocaleContextResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " interface offers an extension to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "LocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " that lets resolvers provide a richer "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "LocaleContext"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", which may include time zone information."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When available, the user’s "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "TimeZone"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " can be obtained by using the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "RequestContext.getTimeZone()"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " method. Time zone information is automatically used by any Date/Time "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Converter"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " and "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Formatter"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " objects that are registered with Spring’s "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "ConversionService"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "mvc-timezone",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Time Zone"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "This locale resolver inspects the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "accept-language"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " header in the request that was sent by the client (for example, a web browser). Usually, this header field contains the locale of the client’s operating system. Note that this resolver does not support time zone information."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "mvc-localeresolver-acceptheader",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Header Resolver"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "This locale resolver inspects a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Cookie"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " that might exist on the client to see if a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Locale"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " or "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "TimeZone"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is specified. If so, it uses the specified details. By using the properties of this locale resolver, you can specify the name of the cookie as well as the maximum age. The following example defines a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "CookieLocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "<bean id=\"localeResolver\" class=\"org.springframework.web.servlet.i18n.CookieLocaleResolver\">\n\n\t<property name=\"cookieName\" value=\"clientlanguage\"/>\n\n\t<!-- in seconds. If set to -1, the cookie is not persisted (deleted when browser shuts down) -->\n\t<property name=\"cookieMaxAge\" value=\"100000\"/>\n\n</bean>"
              }
            ],
            "language": "xml",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The following table describes the properties "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "CookieLocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "autowidth": false,
            "body": [
              [
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "cookieName"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                },
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "class name + LOCALE"
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                },
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "The name of the cookie"
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "cookieMaxAge"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                },
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Servlet container default"
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                },
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "The maximum time a cookie persists on the client. If "
                      },
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "-1"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": " is specified, the cookie will not be persisted. It is available only until the client shuts down the browser."
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "cookiePath"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                },
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "/"
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                },
                {
                  "background": null,
                  "colspan": 1,
                  "halign": "left",
                  "paragraphs": [
                    [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Limits the visibility of the cookie to a certain part of your site. When "
                      },
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "cookiePath"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": " is specified, the cookie is visible only to that path and the paths below it."
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "rowspan": 1,
                  "style": null,
                  "valign": "top"
                }
              ]
            ],
