        "context": "section",
        "id": "mvc-localeresolver-cookie",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Cookie Resolver"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "SessionLocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " lets you retrieve "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Locale"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " and "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "TimeZone"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " from the session that might be associated with the user’s request. In contrast to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "CookieLocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", this strategy stores locally chosen locale settings in the Servlet container’s "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "HttpSession"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". As a consequence, those settings are temporary for each session and are, therefore, lost when each session ends."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Note that there is no direct relationship with external session management mechanisms, such as the Spring Session project. This "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "SessionLocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " evaluates and modifies the corresponding "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "HttpSession"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attributes against the current "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "HttpServletRequest"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "mvc-localeresolver-session",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Session Resolver"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can enable changing of locales by adding the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "LocaleChangeInterceptor"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to one of the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "HandlerMapping"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " definitions. It detects a parameter in the request and changes the locale accordingly, calling the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "setLocale"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " method on the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "LocaleResolver"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " in the dispatcher’s application context. The next example shows that calls to all "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "*.view"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " resources that contain a parameter named "
